 ],
 "balloons": [
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VOICE (off)"
   ],
   "text": "...alive...",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VOICE (off)"
   ],
   "text": "Look at his hands...",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-04",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "VOICE (off)"
   ],
   "text": "See the brand on his arm.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "FISHERMAN"
   ],
   "text": "Easy, *bhau*. You are on land now.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Water.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "YOUNG FISHERMAN"
   ],
   "text": "<He has soldier's calluses. Not a clerk. Not a merchant.>",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "FISHERMAN"
   ],
   "text": "<Look at this.>",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "WARY FISHERMAN"
   ],
   "text": "<Kill him. Why bring trouble to the village?>",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "WARY FISHERMAN"
   ],
   "text": "<The Portuguese will send men for their ship. Better the sea finishes its work.>",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "FISHERMAN"
   ],
   "text": "<The Portuguese and the Dutch ask questions anyway.>",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "FISHERMAN"
   ],
   "text": "<You think leaving one marata on the sand will satisfy either of them?>",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-04",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "FISHERMAN"
   ],
   "text": "<We might as well gain something.>",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "WARY FISHERMAN (off)"
   ],
   "text": "<What? He is half dead.>",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "FISHERMAN"
   ],
   "text": "<Half is still half.>",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-05",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "FISHERMAN"
   ],
   "text": "You fought them, yes?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Yes. On the Deccan roads. Near their forts.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "FISHERMAN"
   ],
   "text": "Our king to the south fights them too. And the other pale ones from the north, the Dutch.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "FISHERMAN"
   ],
   "text": "He sharpens his teeth for them.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-02",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "FISHERMAN"
   ],
   "text": "A man who has seen Portuguese dungeons and still breathes may be useful.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Travancore.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "FISHERMAN"
   ],
   "text": "You know the name.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "I know they have not yet learned to kneel when a foreign flag flies.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-04",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "That is enough.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "FISHERMAN"
   ],
   "text": "You see, he has a tongue as well as scars.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "FISHERMAN"
   ],
   "text": "Come, *bhau*. Before the crabs claim you.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "GIRL"
   ],
   "text": "<Portuguese.>",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "YOUNG FISHERMAN"
   ],
   "text": "<No. Look at his eyes. Look at his mark.>",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "YOUNG FISHERMAN"
   ],
   "text": "<This one is enemy of the Portuguese.>",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "WOMAN"
   ],
   "text": "<Bring him in.>",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "WOMAN"
   ],
   "text": "<If he dies, burn him quietly. Otherwise, send word to the *kapitan*.>",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "FISHERMAN"
   ],
   "text": "She asks what they did to you.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Asked questions.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "FISHERMAN"
   ],
   "text": "She says keep your stories for the *kapitan*.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "FISHERMAN"
   ],
   "text": "She does not need to hear them to know what kind of men they are.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "BOY"
   ],
   "text": "... *kapitan* ... *kapitan* ...",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "FISHERMAN"
   ],
   "text": "Rest. When the *kapitan* comes, speak carefully.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "FISHERMAN"
   ],
   "text": "He works for men who have long arms.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  }
 ]
}